{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_006mak_title", "source_sha256": "83f512545d5d7c2d88e392b12a77644f31a84f0bb82a924978d6b5cab8b37485", "ja": "真と舞台裏", "zh": "真与后台舞台幕后/后台。真与后台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_006mak_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5169c3477b2c78e49f85baf12dcc9f03ff77682e3685a6b4ff2345ba16577282", "ja": "真との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "与真在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_006mak_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "9a8e19aa4bcc8b43507cc658988ddc29716f1614fde57d10bcb2e001bb94b2d3", "ja": "ふう。いよいよ本番ですね、プロデューサー。\n……。へへっ。", "zh": "呼。终于要正式上场了，制作人。\n……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_006mak_1001_402cpr", "source_sha256": "d9c15c412798396f74e017393e8e87299b944e61f7852a67966238043e3012fc", "ja": "ん？　……どうした？", "zh": "嗯？……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_006mak_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "a8d961183f3af31a535e244d7d0fc3b38927886b7617b8c79103a8d2c0d25807", "ja": "いやあ、ちょっと。……「いよいよ本番ですね」って、\nそういえば、今まで何回も言ってきたな～と思って。", "zh": "不是啦，只是……我突然想到，这句“终于要正式上场了呢”，以前好像说过好多次了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_006mak_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "ac1df80061630403e746b3a01c368652ef6af4ab8e76ab5ce7bb744a03b4a840", "ja": "でも、言うたびに新鮮っていうか。\nいつも期待でいっぱいで、ドキドキしてて……。", "zh": "可是每次说起，还是会觉得很新鲜。总是充满期待，心里怦怦直跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_006mak_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "82beda4441369c4c1bc714a6ee3b3179063880bc1face09265f6ffe1438efe3d", "ja": "今回のツアーも、まだまだこれからだし。\nきっとボク、また同じこと、何回も言うんでしょうね！", "zh": "这次的巡演也还只是刚刚开始。\n我肯定还会把同样的话说上好多遍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_006mak_1005_402cpr", "source_sha256": "fa37fb8a8984ef615c6efd1cbe1361d1ebb1975fa4848d806c8c5f30d4bf825d", "ja": "ああ。たぶんツアーが終わった後も、だな。\nこれからは言わないようにするか？", "zh": "啊。大概就算巡演结束后也会这样吧。\n以后要不要尽量不说了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_006mak_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "d588b7573f66de3b4a207d5af0d549e2cf7f350b58e604ce03df4acd31c27cca", "ja": "いいえ、何度だって言わせてもらいますよ！\nこんな嬉しい気持ち、言わないのはもったいないので♪", "zh": "不，我会让你说上多少次都可以！\n这么开心的心情，不说出来就太可惜了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_006mak_1007_402cpr", "source_sha256": "b26fa9210a1a825e8de916384a02504a089535e84ccbbd1f999b5e2b0a387664", "ja": "そうだよな。これからも、何十回でも何百回でも、\n聞かせてもらうよ。よろしくな！", "zh": "是啊。以后不管几十次还是几百次，\n我都会听你说的。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_006mak_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "8312598dbea4acfbf6d7cc6950ce72ee4187c7bc6e1224dc8ecc2575c340f5a5", "ja": "こちらこそ！　このツアーからは、新しい仲間も一緒に\n……毎回みんなでドキドキしますね！", "zh": "我才要请你多关照！从这次巡演开始，还有新的伙伴一起……\n……每次都让大家心跳不已呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
